# ---- numeric paths of the uncertainty, transport and decision routes --------
# Each file below is already covered by the directory line of its facet; it is named
# here so the statistical surface states exactly which sources can move a derived or
# transported number. The facet is the one the covering line assigns, so no record's
# facets change; a narrower facet needs the `allow` review of every referencing file.

# Adaptive-procedure derivations: the exact whole-procedure law, its derived reports and
# the repeated-measures laws and simulation; each is a number a derived-uncertainty
# record or an adaptive-procedure emitter reads.
